128
00:09:33,580 --> 00:09:35,340
Left hand, 60 for both.

129
00:09:35,340 --> 00:09:41,320
Right fist, 80 offensive and defensive.

130
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:45,860
Left elbow, 80 offensive and defensive power.

131
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:59,120
If they keep this up every day for two months, they should be able to fight easily at full speed while still using Ryu.

132
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:03,560
